# Since 1.1.5, upstream has included a systemd service file, related man-page
# and example rule-set, By default the service file is not installed, but the
# man-page and rule-set are.  Since the Debian package provides its own service
# file, the upstream one is not required, so we don't package the man-page or
# rule-set, either.
#
